### Login
# @name valToken
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "email1",
    "senha": "senha1"
}

### consultar cliente id
GET http://localhost:3000/motoristas
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###
POST http://localhost:3000/motorista
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "a",
    "cnh": "cnh1",
    "cpf": "cpf1",
    "telefone": "telefone1"
}